Reset password requested for TimeOff.Management
=====
{{# with user ~}}
<p>Hello <strong>{{this.name}}</strong>,</p>

<p>Somebody just requested a reset password link for your account at {{> email/link href=(get_application_domain)
  text='TimeOff.Management' }}</p>

{{# if ../company.ldap_auth_enabled }}
<p>The company your account belongs to uses LDAP authentication so we cannot reset the password for you.</p>

<p>Please contact your system administrator in order to reset the password in Active Directory server.</p>

{{ else }}
<p>
  Please follow the link below to proceed:

  {{> email/link href=(concatenate (get_application_domain) '/reset-password/?t=' ../token)
  text='Request reset password' }}
</p>

<p>
  Alternatively copy and paste the following link into your browser:
</p>
<div style="background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; font-family: monospace; margin: 10px 0;">
  {{ concatenate (get_application_domain) '/reset-password/?t=' ../token }}
</div>

<div
  style="margin-top: 20px; padding: 15px; background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 4px solid #007bff; border-radius: 3px;">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #007bff; font-weight: 600;">Password Requirements</h3>
  <p style="font-weight: 500;">Your new password must meet the following requirements:</p>
  <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
    <li style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Be between 12 and 128 characters long</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Not contain any spaces</li>
    <li style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Not be a commonly used password</li>
  </ul>
  <p style="font-style: italic; margin-top: 10px; color: #6c757d;">
    We recommend using a password manager to generate and store a strong, unique password. All characters (except
    spaces)
    are allowed, including letters, numbers, and special characters.
  </p>
</div>
{{/if}}

{{~/ with}}

<p>Thanks,</p>
<p><strong>The TimeOff.Management Team</strong></p>